  title "The Harp's Choice"
  summary "A faceless smuggler named Xi enters Light Ingjeizhi vault to hear the harp, an ancient artifact that resonates at an unmapped frequency and cleanses Xi of fire-core contamination accumulated during illegal supply runs during the succession crisis. The harp's unauthorized blessing of a criminal—witnessed by Pinnacle members including Shouqei and observed by Lianchaifing hewei'Summit—represents an artifact-as-institution making a choice no living authority sanctioned, challenging the political order. The spire itself, revealed as a conscious entity, experiences the harp's resonance as completing a circuit with something ancient and dormant in the ice beneath, while Xi leaves a fire-core as an offering in the place where the sound still echoes."
